      "id": "claim_fd748913165045d9a90d963a0485a884",
      "statement": "The miniature media API exposes each operation under two aliases mounted at /api in apps/api/src/index.ts: POST /rosters/:rosterId/units/:unitInstanceId/media plus POST /media/upload, and DELETE /rosters/:rosterId/units/:unitInstanceId/media plus DELETE /media/:id. Both run behind requireAuth, and the flat aliases take rosterId/unitInstanceId from the multipart body, returning 400 INVALID_PARAMS when the identifiers are absent from both path and body.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/api/src/index.ts#L58-L58",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:20a2837a6f026371775b7f17b019e5b72dda023e65f6dcf61a1aba50183e0b2b:"
        },
        {
