      "statement": "The media handlers expose only INVALID_PARAMS, NO_FILE, NOT_FOUND, UPLOAD_ERROR, and DELETE_ERROR to clients inside the standard { success, error } envelope, logging internals to console.error under '[Media Upload]' / '[Media Delete]' instead of returning them.",
